Ultra-heavy minimalist left-field bass drop at exactly 140 BPM. Architecture: massive sub dominance, extreme negative space, surgical rhythmic precision. Pure reference to LYNY “Section” drop — filthy wobbly FM bass that rearranges your chest cavity, simplistic yet devastating sound design, hard-hitting clean drums, zero overproduction. Impact via raw low-end weight and deliberate sparsity. 16–32 bar drop, instrumental, zero melodic filler, zero stutters, zero concessions.

